<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{saveError}}" class="error" bindtap="retry">{{saveError}} 点击重试</view><view class="card"><view class="title">寻居 · 看房手记</view><view class="hint">本地版 · 核心功能免费</view><view>已记录 {{count}} 套房源</view><view class="hint">数据保存在当前设备，不会自动同步到其他手机。定期导出完整备份，可保留照片与视频。</view></view>
 <view class="card"><button class="menu" bindtap="workplace">上班地点<text class="muted">{{settings.workplace||'未设置'}} ›</text></button><button class="menu" data-page="templates" bindtap="open">检查模板<text class="muted">{{settings.template}} ›</text></button><button class="menu" data-page="archive" bindtap="open">归档房源<text class="muted">{{archived}} 套 ›</text></button><button class="menu" bindtap="replayGuide">重新查看引导<text class="muted">›</text></button><view class="menu"><text>新房源显示操作引导</text><switch color="#4D56DF" checked="{{settings.onboarding}}" bindchange="onboarding"/></view></view>
 <view class="section-title">数据与备份</view><view class="card"><button class="menu menu-import" bindtap="importFile">导入房源<text class="muted">ZIP ›</text></button><button class="menu menu-export" bindtap="export">导出房源<text class="muted">ZIP ›</text></button><button class="menu" bindtap="recover">恢复上一次本机保存<text>›</text></button></view>
